create-adaptive-approval-emails.formulaOrCode:
Trigger: When an item is created (Requests)

Compose_Approver
  if(
    greater(triggerBody()?['Amount'], 5000),
    triggerBody()?['Director']?['Email'],
    triggerBody()?['Manager']?['Email']
  )

Compose_Details  (Markdown, supported by Approvals)
  concat(
    '**Requester:** ', triggerBody()?['Author']?['DisplayName'], '\n\n',
    '**Type:** ', triggerBody()?['RequestType']?['Value'], '\n\n',
    '**Amount:** ', formatNumber(coalesce(triggerBody()?['Amount'], 0), 'N2'), '\n\n',
    if(empty(triggerBody()?['Justification']), '',
       concat('**Justification:** ', triggerBody()?['Justification']))
  )

Start and wait for an approval
  Approval type : Approve/Reject - First to respond
  Title         : @{triggerBody()?['RequestType']?['Value']} request: @{triggerBody()?['Title']}
  Assigned to   : @{outputs('Compose_Approver')}
  Details       : @{outputs('Compose_Details')}
  Item link     : @{triggerBody()?['{Link}']}
  Item link description : Open the request

Condition
  outputs('Start_and_wait_for_an_approval')?['body/outcome']  is equal to  Approve

create-an-approval-audit-trail-in-sharep.formulaOrCode:
List: Approval History
  Title        Single line    request title
  RequestId    Number         (indexed)
  Stage        Choice         Manager | Finance | Director
  Outcome      Choice         Approve | Reject
  Approver     Person
  Comments     Multiple lines (plain)
  RequestedOn  Date and time
  RespondedOn  Date and time

Start and wait for an approval  ->  action name "Approval"

Apply to each: outputs('Approval')?['body/responses']
