    RequestedOn : @{outputs('Approval')?['body/requestDate']}
    RespondedOn : @{items('Apply_to_each')?['responseDate']}

Update item (Requests)
  Status          : @{if(equals(outputs('Approval')?['body/outcome'], 'Approve'), 'Approved', 'Rejected')}
  LastDecisionBy  : @{first(outputs('Approval')?['body/responses'])?['responder']?['email']}
  LastDecisionOn  : @{outputs('Approval')?['body/completionDate']}

Permissions
  Approval History: requesters Read, flow account Contribute, nobody else can edit

build-a-small-business-pto-request-workf.formulaOrCode:
List: Time Off Requests
  Title        Single line   (set by flow: "<Name> - <Type>")
  LeaveType    Choice        Holiday | Sick | Unpaid | Other
  StartDate    Date
  EndDate      Date
  Notes        Multiple lines
  Status       Choice        Submitted | Approved | Rejected   (default Submitted)
  Approver     Person
  DecisionNote Multiple lines
  Validation   EndDate >= StartDate   (list validation formula: =[EndDate]>=[StartDate])

Trigger: When an item is created

Get manager (V2)
  User (UPN): @{triggerBody()?['Author']?['Email']}
  Configure run after on the next step: is successful, has failed

Compose_Approver
  coalesce(outputs('Get_manager_(V2)')?['body/mail'], 'office@contoso.com')

Start and wait for an approval (Approve/Reject - First to respond)
  Title       : Time off: @{triggerBody()?['Author']?['DisplayName']}
  Assigned to : @{outputs('Compose_Approver')}
  Details     : **@{triggerBody()?['LeaveType']?['Value']}** from
                @{formatDateTime(triggerBody()?['StartDate'], 'ddd d MMM')} to
                @{formatDateTime(triggerBody()?['EndDate'], 'ddd d MMM yyyy')}

Update item
  Status       : @{if(equals(outputs('Start_and_wait_for_an_approval')?['body/outcome'], 'Approve'), 'Approved', 'Rejected')}
  Approver     : @{first(outputs('Start_and_wait_for_an_approval')?['body/responses'])?['responder']?['email']}
  DecisionNote : @{first(outputs('Start_and_wait_for_an_approval')?['body/responses'])?['comments']}

Condition: outcome is Approve
  Create event (V4) in the shared "Team Leave" calendar
    Subject    : @{triggerBody()?['Author']?['DisplayName']} - @{triggerBody()?['LeaveType']?['Value']}
    Start      : @{triggerBody()?['StartDate']}
    End        : @{addDays(triggerBody()?['EndDate'], 1)}
    All day    : Yes      Show as: Free

Send an email (V2) to the requester with the outcome and DecisionNote

route-approvals-by-vendor-category.formulaOrCode:
List: Category Reviews
  Title (vendor category, indexed) | ReviewName | ReviewerEmail | Required (Yes/No)
  Software   | Security review   | security@contoso.com
  Software   | Data protection   | privacy@contoso.com
  Contractor | Insurance check   | risk@contoso.com
  Any        | Finance setup     | finance@contoso.com

Get items (Category Reviews)
  Filter Query : (Title eq '@{triggerBody()?['VendorCategory']?['Value']}' or Title eq 'Any') and Required eq 1

Apply to each review   (Concurrency: On, 10, so reviews run together)
