After the loop
  Get items (Vendor Review Results)
    Filter Query : RequestId eq @{triggerBody()?['ID']} and Outcome eq 'Reject'
  Update item
    Status : @{if(greater(length(body('Get_items_2')?['value']), 0), 'Rejected', 'Approved')}

