Library columns
  DocType (Choice: Policy, Procedure, Contract, Form) | ApprovalStatus (Choice: Draft, In review, Approved, Rejected)
  ApprovedBy (Person) | ApprovedOn (Date)

List: Document Approvers
  Title (DocType, indexed) | Approver (Person)

