    Team    : @{outputs('Compose_Service')?['TeamsGroupId']}
    Channel : @{outputs('Compose_Service')?['TeamsChannelId']}
    Message : New request: @{triggerBody()?['Title']} from @{triggerBody()?['Author']?['DisplayName']}
              @{triggerBody()?['{Link}']}

send-teams-cards-for-new-high-priority-i.formulaOrCode:
Trigger: When an item is created (Issues)
  Trigger condition: @equals(triggerBody()?['Priority']?['Value'], 'High')

Post adaptive card and wait for a response   (Flow bot, Channel)
{
  "type": "AdaptiveCard",
  "$schema": "http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json",
  "version": "1.4",
  "body": [
    { "type": "TextBlock", "text": "High priority issue", "weight": "Bolder", "color": "Attention", "size": "Medium" },
    { "type": "TextBlock", "text": "@{triggerBody()?['Title']}", "wrap": true, "weight": "Bolder" },
    { "type": "TextBlock", "text": "@{coalesce(triggerBody()?['Description'], '')}", "wrap": true, "maxLines": 4 },
    { "type": "FactSet", "facts": [
      { "title": "Reported by", "value": "@{triggerBody()?['Author']?['DisplayName']}" },
      { "title": "Area", "value": "@{coalesce(triggerBody()?['Area']?['Value'], 'Not set')}" }
    ] }
  ],
  "actions": [
    { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "I'll take it", "id": "take" },
    { "type": "Action.OpenUrl", "title": "Open issue", "url": "@{triggerBody()?['{Link}']}" }
  ]
}
  Update message : Taken by the person who responded. Open the issue for details.
  Settings > Timeout : PT2H

Update item (run after: is successful)
  AssignedTo Claims : @{body('Post_adaptive_card_and_wait_for_a_response')?['responder']?['userPrincipalName']}
  Status            : In progress

Escalate (run after: has timed out)
  Post message in a chat or channel: Nobody has taken "@{triggerBody()?['Title']}" after two hours.
  Send an email to the team lead (Importance: High)

send-owner-notifications-for-reassigned-.formulaOrCode:
Columns: AssignedTo (Person) | LastNotifiedOwner (Single line, hidden) | HandoverNote (Multiple lines)

Trigger: When an item is created or modified
  Trigger condition:
    @and(
      not(empty(triggerBody()?['AssignedTo']?['Email'])),
      not(equals(toLower(triggerBody()?['AssignedTo']?['Email']), toLower(coalesce(triggerBody()?['LastNotifiedOwner'], ''))))
    )

Compose_Previous   coalesce(triggerBody()?['LastNotifiedOwner'], '')

