  Recipient : @{triggerBody()?['AssignedTo']?['Email']}
  Message   : <b>@{triggerBody()?['Title']}</b> has been assigned to you by @{triggerBody()?['Editor']?['DisplayName']}.<br>
              Due: @{if(empty(triggerBody()?['DueDate']), 'not set', formatDateTime(triggerBody()?['DueDate'], 'd MMM yyyy'))}<br>
              Handover note: @{coalesce(triggerBody()?['HandoverNote'], 'None')}<br>
              <a href="@{triggerBody()?['{Link}']}">Open item</a>

Condition: not(empty(outputs('Compose_Previous')))
  Yes: Send an email (V2)
    To      : @{outputs('Compose_Previous')}
    Subject : @{triggerBody()?['Title']} has moved to @{triggerBody()?['AssignedTo']?['DisplayName']}

Update item
  LastNotifiedOwner : @{triggerBody()?['AssignedTo']?['Email']}

