create-audit-rows-for-status-changes.formulaOrCode:
List: Status History
  Title | ItemId (Number, indexed) | FromStatus | ToStatus | ChangedBy (Person) | ChangedOn (Date and time)
  HoursInPrevious (Number)

Source list hidden columns: PreviousStatus (text), StatusChangedOn (date and time)

Trigger: When an item is created or modified
  Trigger condition:
    @not(equals(triggerBody()?['Status']?['Value'], coalesce(triggerBody()?['PreviousStatus'], '')))

Compose_Hours
  if(empty(triggerBody()?['StatusChangedOn']), 0,
     div(sub(ticks(triggerBody()?['Modified']), ticks(triggerBody()?['StatusChangedOn'])), 36000000000))

Create item (Status History)
  Title           : @{triggerBody()?['Title']}
  ItemId          : @{triggerBody()?['ID']}
  FromStatus      : @{coalesce(triggerBody()?['PreviousStatus'], '(new)')}
  ToStatus        : @{triggerBody()?['Status']?['Value']}
  ChangedBy       : @{triggerBody()?['Editor']?['Email']}
  ChangedOn       : @{triggerBody()?['Modified']}
  HoursInPrevious : @{outputs('Compose_Hours')}

Update item (source)
  PreviousStatus  : @{triggerBody()?['Status']?['Value']}
  StatusChangedOn : @{triggerBody()?['Modified']}

Report: average HoursInPrevious grouped by FromStatus shows where requests wait.

create-recurring-review-tasks-for-polici.formulaOrCode:
