Update a task (Planner)   Progress: Completed

create-closeout-reminders-for-completed-.formulaOrCode:
Columns (Projects): Status | CompletedOn | CloseoutDue | ProjectManager
  Closeout checks (Yes/No): LessonsLearnedDone | FinalReportDone | DocumentsArchived | BenefitsOwnerAgreed

Flow 1: start closeout
Trigger: Projects modified, trigger condition
  @and(equals(triggerBody()?['Status']?['Value'], 'Complete'), empty(triggerBody()?['CloseoutDue']))
Update item
  CompletedOn : @{utcNow()}
  CloseoutDue : @{addDays(utcNow(), 30, 'yyyy-MM-dd')}

Flow 2: weekly reminders
Trigger: Recurrence (weekly, Monday)

Get items (Projects)
  Filter Query : Status eq 'Complete' and (LessonsLearnedDone eq 0 or FinalReportDone eq 0 or DocumentsArchived eq 0 or BenefitsOwnerAgreed eq 0)

Apply to each project
  Compose_Outstanding
    concat(
      if(equals(items('Apply_to_each')?['LessonsLearnedDone'], true), '', '<li>Lessons learned session</li>'),
      if(equals(items('Apply_to_each')?['FinalReportDone'], true), '', '<li>Final report</li>'),
      if(equals(items('Apply_to_each')?['DocumentsArchived'], true), '', '<li>Archive project documents</li>'),
      if(equals(items('Apply_to_each')?['BenefitsOwnerAgreed'], true), '', '<li>Agree a benefits owner</li>')
    )
  Compose_Overdue   less(items('Apply_to_each')?['CloseoutDue'], utcNow())

  Send an email (V2)
    To      : @{items('Apply_to_each')?['ProjectManager']?['Email']}
    CC      : @{if(outputs('Compose_Overdue'), 'pmo@contoso.com', '')}
    Subject : @{if(outputs('Compose_Overdue'), 'Overdue: ', '')}Closeout for @{items('Apply_to_each')?['Title']}
    Body    : <p>Still to do before this project can be closed:</p><ul>@{outputs('Compose_Outstanding')}</ul>
              <p>Due @{formatDateTime(items('Apply_to_each')?['CloseoutDue'], 'd MMMM yyyy')}.
                 <a href="@{items('Apply_to_each')?['{Link}']}">Update the project record</a></p>

Flow 3 (optional): when all four are Yes, set Status = Closed.

parse-adaptive-card-responses-into-decis.formulaOrCode:
Card inputs and actions (ids matter)
  { "type": "Input.ChoiceSet", "id": "decision", "choices": [
      { "title": "Approve", "value": "Approved" },
      { "title": "Reject", "value": "Rejected" },
      { "title": "Need more information", "value": "MoreInfo" } ] }
  { "type": "Input.Text", "id": "comments", "isMultiline": true }
  { "type": "Input.Date", "id": "reviewBy" }
  { "type": "Input.Toggle", "id": "urgent", "valueOn": "true", "valueOff": "false" }
  "actions": [ { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Submit", "id": "submit" },
               { "type": "Action.Submit", "title": "Skip", "id": "skip", "data": { "decision": "Skipped" } } ]

Response shape
  body('Post_adaptive_card_and_wait_for_a_response')
    .data.decision | .data.comments | .data.reviewBy | .data.urgent
    .submitActionId
    .responder.displayName | .responder.email | .responder.userPrincipalName
    .responseTime

Compose_Data       body('Post_adaptive_card_and_wait_for_a_response')?['data']
Compose_Decision   coalesce(outputs('Compose_Data')?['decision'], 'NoSelection')
Compose_Comments   trim(coalesce(outputs('Compose_Data')?['comments'], ''))
Compose_Urgent     equals(outputs('Compose_Data')?['urgent'], 'true')

Validate: a rejection needs a reason
  Condition: and(equals(outputs('Compose_Decision'), 'Rejected'), empty(outputs('Compose_Comments')))
    Yes: post a follow-up message asking for a reason, then post the card again

Update item
  Status       : @{outputs('Compose_Decision')}
  DecisionNote : @{outputs('Compose_Comments')}
  DecidedBy    : @{body('Post_adaptive_card_and_wait_for_a_response')?['responder']?['email']}
  DecidedOn    : @{body('Post_adaptive_card_and_wait_for_a_response')?['responseTime']}
  ReviewBy     : @{if(empty(outputs('Compose_Data')?['reviewBy']), null, outputs('Compose_Data')?['reviewBy'])}

parse-approval-comments-into-audit-notes.formulaOrCode:
After "Start and wait for an approval" (action name: Approval)

Select_Lines   (text mode)
  From : @{outputs('Approval')?['body/responses']}
  Map  : @concat(
           formatDateTime(item()?['responseDate'], 'dd MMM yyyy HH:mm'), ' - ',
           item()?['responder']?['displayName'], ': ',
           item()?['approverResponse'],
           if(empty(item()?['comments']), '', concat(' - "', item()?['comments'], '"'))
         )

Compose_StageNote
  concat(
    '[', 'Manager approval', '] ',
    join(body('Select_Lines'), decodeUriComponent('%0A'))
  )

Get item   (re-read so earlier notes are current)

Update item
  ApprovalNotes : @{concat(
                     coalesce(body('Get_item')?['ApprovalNotes'], ''),
                     if(empty(body('Get_item')?['ApprovalNotes']), '', decodeUriComponent('%0A')),
                     outputs('Compose_StageNote')
                   )}
  LastOutcome   : @{outputs('Approval')?['body/outcome']}

Result in the column
  [Manager approval] 20 Nov 2026 09:14 - Jane Doe: Approve - "Budget confirmed"
  [Finance approval] 20 Nov 2026 11:02 - Sam Lee: Approve

Alternative: set the notes column to "Append changes to existing text" and write only the new stage note.

patch-a-sharepoint-yes-no-field-from-pow.formulaOrCode:
// Toggle or checkbox in a custom form
Patch(
    Requests,
    LookUp(Requests, ID = varRecord.ID),
    { IsUrgent: tglUrgent.Value }          // checkbox: chkUrgent.Value
)

// Button that marks the selected row as acknowledged
Patch(
    Requests,
    galRequests.Selected,
    { Acknowledged: true, AcknowledgedOn: Now() }
);
Notify("Marked as acknowledged", NotificationType.Success)

// Flip the current value
Patch(Requests, ThisItem, { IsActive: !ThisItem.IsActive })

// New record with a default
Patch(Requests, Defaults(Requests), { Title: txtTitle.Text, IsUrgent: false })

// Filtering: compare with true or false, do not rely on the bare column
Filter(Requests, IsUrgent = true)
Filter(Requests, IsActive = false)      // blank values are not matched. See troubleshooting.

// Edit form data card: Update property
DataCardValue_IsUrgent.Value

patch-a-sharepoint-currency-field.formulaOrCode:
// Save button OnSelect
With(
    {
        // remove symbols and separators the user may have typed
        raw: Substitute(Substitute(Substitute(Trim(txtAmount.Text), "$", ""), "£", ""), ",", "")
    },
    If(
        IsBlank(raw) || !IsNumeric(raw),
        Notify("Enter the amount as a number, for example 1250.50", NotificationType.Error),
        Value(raw) < 0,
        Notify("Amount cannot be negative", NotificationType.Error),
        IfError(
            Patch(
                Requests,
                Coalesce(varRecord, Defaults(Requests)),
