create-dependent-checklist-rows-from-a-t.formulaOrCode:
Lists
  Checklist Templates : Title | TemplateType (Choice) | SortOrder (Number) | DueOffsetDays (Number) | OwnerRole (Text)
  Checklist Items     : Title | ParentId (Number, indexed) | SortOrder | DueDate | Status (Choice) | OwnerRole

